```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant U as User
    participant UI as Client UI
    participant RT as Agent Runtime
    participant DB as Message Store
    participant CE as Context Engine
    participant MR as Memory Retriever
    participant TR as Thread Retriever
    participant CP as Conversation Planner
    participant LLM as Companion Model
    participant OV as Output Validator
    participant WS as WebSocket
    participant Q as Background Queue

    U->>UI: Send message
    UI->>RT: HTTP or WebSocket message
    RT->>DB: Store raw user message
    DB-->>RT: Message ID

    par Retrieve context
        RT->>MR: Retrieve relevant memories
        MR-->>RT: Small ranked memory set
    and Retrieve threads
        RT->>TR: Retrieve active or related threads
        TR-->>RT: Relevant thread summaries
    and Read conversation
        RT->>DB: Recent messages
        DB-->>RT: Recent conversation window
    end

    RT->>CP: Decide conversational posture
    CP-->>RT: Listen, answer, explore or continue thread

    RT->>CE: Compile bounded model context
    CE-->>RT: System prompt and contextual messages

    RT->>LLM: Generate natural response
    LLM-->>RT: Plain companion reply

    RT->>OV: Validate and sanitize
    OV-->>RT: Safe user-visible reply

    RT->>DB: Store agent message
    RT->>Q: Queue conversation observation
    RT->>WS: Deliver reply
    WS-->>UI: Display agent message
```